{"id":"5df8a0a6a64810cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-logic-type-space.md","title":"ZFC Logic Type Space","display":"df-zfc-logic-type-space — ZFC Logic Type Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-type-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-type-space"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-type-space — ZFC Logic Type Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-type-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-type-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-type-space — ZFC Logic Type Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,\\mathcal L,n\\in V\">\\(S,T,\\mathcal L,n\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the bounded-free-variable formula set defined below using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\)</span> are as in the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicTypeSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicTypeSpace}_S\\)</span> is the four-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}type\\text{-}space\\text{-}formulas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}type\\text{-}space\\text{-}formulas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}type\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLogicTypeSpace}_S(S,T,\\mathcal L,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;S=\\left\\{p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L):\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\forall s&#39;\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s&#39;)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\theta,s&#39;))\\land p=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}type\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLogicTypeSpace}_S(S,T,\\mathcal L,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;S=\\left\\{p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L):\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\forall s&#39;\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s&#39;)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\theta,s&#39;))\\land p=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is the set of realized complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-types over the empty parameter set.</li>\n<li>The language and the assignment used to realize a type are explicit; no unbound satisfaction notation remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,\\mathcal L,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicTypeSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}type\\text{-}space\\text{-}formulas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<n\\}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}type\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcLogicTypeSpace}_S(S,T,\\mathcal L,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,\\mathcal L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land{}\\\\\n&S=\\left\\{p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L):\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left.\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\forall\\theta\\in T\\;\\forall s'\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s')\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\theta,s'))\\land p=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^n(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\}\\Bigr)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2103,